config UT_SOCFPGA
	bool "Enable SoC FPGA sandbox unit tests"
	depends on SANDBOX
	default y
	help
	  This enables the 'ut socfpga' command, which runs sandbox unit
	  tests covering Altera SoC FPGA drivers. RSU is the first driver
	  to ship under this suite (test/socfpga/rsu.c); FPGA manager, SDM
	  mailbox, sysmgr and similar drivers are expected to add their
	  own test/socfpga/<driver>.c files as they get sandbox-ported,
	  with no further sandbox-harness plumbing required.
